          <circle cx="115" cy="137" r="7" fill="#f4d06f" stroke="#d4a373" stroke-width="2" />
          <path d="M115 133 L117 137 L121 137 L118 140 L119 144 L115 141 L111 144 L112 140 L109 137 L113 137 Z" fill="#e85454" />
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-text">
        <h2>Hello, friend!</h2>
        <p>I'm Pobrecita. I may be tiny, but I have endless love to give. Pet me, give me a treat, or tell the world about my sweet face.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <button class="btn-pet" id="petBtn">Pet Pobrecita</button>
          <button class="btn-treat" id="treatBtn">Give Treat (<span id="treatCount">0</span>)</button>
